// Detonated at a chosen point up to 27 m away -- the exact same conflict
// assets/common/abilities/spells/evocation/acid_splash.ron (Wave 1) already
// documents: CharacterAbility::Explosion always detonates centered on the
// caster's own position (common/src/states/explosion.rs has no
// target-point field at all), so despite the sheet's own listed
// `"variant": "Explosion"`, this uses GroundAoe instead, the engine's real
// "detonate at a chosen point within range" primitive -- same deviation,
// same reasoning as acid_splash.ron.
//
// GroundAoe also hardcodes DamageKind::Energy in
// common/src/states/ground_aoe.rs (no RON-configurable damage_kind field
// exists on this variant) -- so despite the Cold flavor text, this deals
// generic Energy damage under the hood, same drift already documented on
// acid_splash.ron.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    delay: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    max_range: 27.0,
    radius: 3.0,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    damage: 24,
    poise: 8,
    knockback: (strength: 3, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
